<h2 class="bold" id="accessibility-considerations"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="color-palette#accessibility-considerations">Accessibility Considerations</a></h2>
<h3 class="bold" id="color-contrast"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="color-palette#color-contrast">Color Contrast</a></h3>
<p>All color combinations in our system meet WCAG 2.1 AA standards:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Text colors</strong> have minimum 4.5:1 contrast ratio with their backgrounds</li>
<li><strong>Large text</strong> (18pt+ or 14pt+ bold) has minimum 3:1 contrast ratio</li>
<li><strong>Interactive elements</strong> maintain contrast in all states</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="bold" id="color-independence"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="color-palette#color-independence">Color Independence</a></h3>
<p>Never rely solely on color to convey information:</p>
<p>✅ <strong>Good</strong>: Use color + icons + text labels</p>
